- Humeau Y, Doussau F, Popoff MR, Benfenati F, Poulain B (2007) Fast changes in the functional status of release sites during short-term plasticity: involvement of a frequency-dependent bypass of Rac at Aplysia synapses. *J Physiol* 583(Pt 3):983-1004. — variance-to-mean relative-change analysis of $N$- vs $P$-driven changes.
- van Huijstee AN, Kessels HW (2020) Variance analysis as a tool to predict the mechanism underlying synaptic plasticity. *J Neurosci Methods* 331:108526.
